  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;non-zero distinct real numbers such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then",
